---
source: crates/mercury-schema/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "json!({ \"input\": input, \"output\": output })"
---
{
  "input": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "title": "HealthArgs",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "output": {
    "$defs": {
      "BuildStatus": {
        "enum": [
          "passed",
          "failed",
          "running",
          "none"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "CiRun": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "The latest CI run: `at` is `null` when the status is `none`.",
        "properties": {
          "at": {
            "format": "date-time",
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "status": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/BuildStatus"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "status",
          "at"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "LastRelease": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "at": {
            "format": "date-time",
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "name": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/SafeText"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "name",
          "at"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "OpenPrs": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "count": {
            "format": "uint32",
            "minimum": 0,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "oldest_days": {
            "format": "uint32",
            "minimum": 0,
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "count",
          "oldest_days"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "Ratio": {
        "maximum": 1,
        "minimum": 0,
        "type": "number"
      },
      "SafeText": {
        "description": "One line of redacted text: no code, paths, identifiers, URLs, e-mail addresses or secrets.",
        "format": "safe-text",
        "maxLength": 120,
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "SchemaId": {
        "const": "mercury.facts/0.1",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "Score": {
        "description": "A health score from 0 to 100.",
        "format": "uint8",
        "maximum": 100,
        "minimum": 0,
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "TodoFixme": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "TODO and FIXME markers. `null` as a whole in `metadata` mode.",
        "properties": {
          "count": {
            "format": "uint32",
            "minimum": 0,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "trend_14d": {
            "description": "The change in the count over the last 14 days, negative when it fell.",
            "format": "int32",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "count",
          "trend_14d"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "description": "The reply of `health`.",
    "properties": {
      "as_of": {
        "format": "date-time",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "build": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/CiRun"
      },
      "ci_pass_rate_7d": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/Ratio"
      },
      "last_release": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/LastRelease"
      },
      "open_prs": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/OpenPrs"
      },
      "schema": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/SchemaId"
      },
      "score": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/Score"
      },
      "todo_fixme": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/TodoFixme"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "schema",
      "as_of",
      "build",
      "ci_pass_rate_7d",
      "open_prs",
      "todo_fixme",
      "last_release",
      "score"
    ],
    "title": "HealthReply",
    "type": "object"
  }
}
